{"version":1,"content":"<p>《試真D唷》由江美儀、朱敏瀚、吳業坤、曾展望（GM）及張振朗主持。</p><p>今晚（25日）一集繼續台北「試真D」，內容夠衝擊，先有「刀療按摩」體驗，再挑戰「酒場任務」，最後食路邊攤雞肉飯食到身水身汗，全程爆笑與驚嚇齊飛。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:03.594797+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T06:37:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T08:18:10.128881+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:13.798660+00:00","content_hash":"4d546be97b8df9b87cfa412526b060df2c6bde0a355a27b8d39a44dcd3a9306b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}